# Cross-origin isolation, required for SharedArrayBuffer and therefore for the
# multithreaded ffmpeg core used by the video converter. Without these headers
# the converter still works, but falls back to a single CPU core.
#
# Safe to apply site-wide: the only cross-origin subresources anywhere in the
# site are the jsDelivr scripts, and jsDelivr sends
# "cross-origin-resource-policy: cross-origin". There are no cross-origin
# images or iframes. If one is ever added it must send CORP, or it will be
# blocked here.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
